  "title": "Banana Split Cake Bars",
  "description": "Bananas, crushed pineapple and maraschino cherries are all baked into a cake. A light, buttery frosting is applied, and the cake is cut into bars for snacking.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
